flowchart LR
    %% Row 1
    B[app.py receives prompt]
    B --> C[Check for company or ticker]
    C -->|No| D[General chat only<br/>chatbot.py replies without scoring]
    C -->|Yes| E[Resolve ticker with yfinance]

    %% Row 2
    E --> F[financial.py<br/>Pull Yahoo ratios<br/>Isolation Forest]
    F --> G[Build financial flags<br/>and summary]

    E --> H[sentiment.py<br/>Load Webhose articles<br/>TF-IDF + Logistic Regression]

    %% Row 3
    H --> I[Build sentiment label<br/>and news summary]

    J[risk.py combines signals<br/>85 percent financial / 15 percent sentiment]


    %% Row 4
    J --> K[Convert raw risk to trust score<br/>and risk level]

    K --> L[chatbot.py formats explanation]
    L --> M[Streamlit shows score<br/>summary<br/>recommendation]
    M --> N[User sees concise decision support]

    K <-->K1[Earning Server]
    K1 <-->K2[Financial Knowledge Base]
    